# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Contact form configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and fill in the values.
# If VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT is left empty, the contact form gracefully
# falls back to opening the visitor's mail client (mailto:) instead.

# --- Option A: Web3Forms (https://web3forms.com) -------------------
# 1. Create a free access key (no account needed) at web3forms.com.
# 2. Set the endpoint to the Web3Forms submit URL and paste your key.
# VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://api.web3forms.com/submit
# VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key

# --- Option B: Formspree (https://formspree.io) -------------------
# 1. Create a form, copy its endpoint (looks like https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz).
# 2. Set only the endpoint below; leave VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY unset.
# VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
